  "window_artifact": "solve_mmgnlse multiplies the nonlinear term by damped_freq_window(nt) (src/backend/fft_utils.jl): 1 for negative detuning, rolling off above 0.34 nt domega on the positive side (68 rad/ps for nt=512, 53 rad/ps for nt=400; ~0.013 at the positive Nyquist). Single-time-bin quadratures have flat spectra, so the full-V lambda_min is corrupted: at beta2=0 the solver gives 0.0048058 against 0.0098049 for the exact time-local map on the same grid, the map is not symplectic (max|S J S^T - J| = 2.0). Output modes inside |omega| <= 60 rad/ps (nt=512) are unaffected: lambda_min_band agrees with the exact map to ~1e-8 relative. lambda_gen agrees with the exact map to 3e-9 and changes by 3e-11 if all output modes outside 60 rad/ps are replaced by vacuum.",
